{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 546,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11014f50421988b7ba478eeb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "肯定胜负难料的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8695feac1c0962fa6a028e97469ad9b093e0a049dfaad8c1069974d2b2790917",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e369bdd5cfd0ef948863789b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞争激烈的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color> ROUND2开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e0e10f52353acdc90719f0d567e55b0d5d7722a06c92bc7dc6562a595a740da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0f6763ad1aaea6d3e2fd688",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝对不会停下来，<color=#ff9900>群英月赛\\n<race_name></color> ROUND2。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd23cddf9fafb5d20ca190eb9b090de085340cbffed7bbb0ecd655a33ae8a468",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:973efa79ca467772342a6782",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘齐聚，<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> ROUND2。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a4cedf71a5eee1414d73b966189c29afb38ec486f1d016fa5e5c14cbe94aef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:252a86cd99885cefb95a5835",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ROUND1结束，强者云集的ROUND2。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69930f16a0df648713d2fba17772fb274a4f4f13b5263b45a9e3f6df7a4e1b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbc3433ba583c2c501e74b05",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "王牌云集，仅有三女神才知道结果，备受瞩目的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bc2c65b99115d664c9d45ceadce3e95a2f46f5fde017c72ed459b51110ff35",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a7c598b3eaf6ca86e3534c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从全国各地聚集而来的精锐，在热烈的欢呼声中展现魅力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abce797f7f15c3dda54d071839b7ba8bd01eb0fd11a00c718dc919c7b2a96631",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd46e9c894ead6c2cff4f07",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所有人的实力都是货真价实，谁赢都不奇怪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "389ed646929795cb3d67f43bc5f117ac5fe0d23b26e5708771a398357d8b7a92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b7be323f9b719f8d1c012de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "展翅飞向未来，备受期待的赛马娘们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28d799f73efa39e2bb85dfc80197c77ae2f42eee67bcbff9a113c3afdea59752",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b08f9c3dcc7bac6dd4f01d6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参赛的赛马娘都颇具实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "494c891eb639886ec8887be192835407158e1972d24ba822b1981b2b7d046bbe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6ebd693bffa4a38931a9662",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "演员齐聚一堂，受众人瞩目的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6dae00a974a9464e1650949aa577e687eb0084a76065855f8fa23ad0398122ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2c60c4a098d3b8ac2ba28b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各赛马娘的实力在伯仲之间，能期待是场高水平的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af95488caa6b3af0186e27d9d878e280eb77b83e4d1fc77c8b579c4c5163779d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe40dc9d7afcbccd7c0cc029",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "聚集了难得的优秀成员，是粉丝必看的竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0b77bb1d166abbc1b1f60d7cd196ef68015b29669ad30ef6aac6706813eaed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dfe7b6dd01bfd3bfc080707",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加的都是强者，备受瞩目的一战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c45cc2ffa58b92cd9a91422afa9b9d0180b7cc258c4d9b308d8776329a1e2154",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:000ce97b1565398752d605df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "粉丝也抱持高度期待的盛大竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de9b92ceaccc59711e6082b3ec3e85dd2a8ce9f8409ba7cfb825543e3552c9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:934f01fac09b2f36993bb2ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会是目标为进入决赛的三方齐聚一堂的重要一役。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a1930322d7091b4839fee7d3aa3158b4c504d84fa64a34d08777a29cb010b12",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54b83bd3411954aecd2d6f4c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "实力相当，在抵达终点前都不能移开视线的精彩竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f3ec4972d2e19e80d30bd3fbcdba7ae18bce324a724b2ce2277ed9b43b24fef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3300"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18d44f43e7fc9430647a912b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<season>晴朗的<race_course>赛场，备受瞩目的赛马娘齐聚一堂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "060aa7ad8dd70abd44a3734b8f5b1599f556d052887e42687380f50ef5d1dd30",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b79745857137b953c2349d21",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不是赢，就是输！胜利者只有一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a014d1c0e8fa3108d64d2699e1bf709b1635bd04edb029a3b12881e4f7351bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3302"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c9d036889dfba2faafc25a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "任何赛马娘都会在此鼓起冲劲的重要场合。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64e68791ea0aedd3482e8326a4250f45e262d6215ec7c3e1ac9b1c9aeba3dac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3303"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2cc6cc769bc9ee40da9dda5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家抱着对胜利的强烈决心挑战对手们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91752906d51a6d566a72002b2b99c9e655de53754eb836e39c9283d45b645bf9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3304"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56efe3ddff338bcd7fa55c78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一场不论谁获胜都不奇怪的激烈竞赛就此开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c29b0f7625731520ed41b67b6528c23c96594904c2d46c434d393cf740533748",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df8deb626c1d528b4ef0f283",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "受到瞩目的赛马娘们一边竞争，一边奔驰在<race_distance>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e74794e61ea3457739e8af9e7ec4c6eef761c4b4832131b3c074dd792c9c5a3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3306"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00293a2643f52ea43c73ebcf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比任何地方都长，也比任何地方都短的<race_course>的<race_distance>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22116d467121ec75700bc711bd442b1943a3931cb7d3de4342da94a2e4248d8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20a59a4c09b5b5671f866585",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会是目标为进入决赛的三方齐聚一堂的重要一役。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a1930322d7091b4839fee7d3aa3158b4c504d84fa64a34d08777a29cb010b12",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3308"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:479a73d5048d864599cb2f8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁能成为最后的优胜者……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b53750a723e4f62eba0cd50ff63072ed286b5e243be1d7df27ede38a1626ecc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3400"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a1fb510203ca1ee6e7a0b1d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "究竟会是哪位赛马娘能以第1的成绩抵达终点……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9f4252372774d4c771bd649939cafd08d81797da6ce60ecdb0264fc0bf5a562",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4163817d301281b80bb86db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁能够第1个跑完<race_distance>呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c8eb3e7907ae1647485b4a9d6e316c7c338d06c1c7c0c94efcca1158a96e451",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef13bd5492979418e4076a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最快的会是谁……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbda784640152285c8d2c32943fac5e0c75a7e79d754c80aa5618e3e1cea8410",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3403"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:828893b4e33f36bcbc2bb7b5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "专注看着前方迈进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06bdca4fae7bc1bb23665083e7310967acb8b3d4247b161598ca2630790063f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3404"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49efa87560817c7a155f557b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在抵达终点前无法移开视线！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26e1a96a39a20d7a74f96fc75a45a636e820fc3c14885e0c231ee48047c85950",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a3bf7a2fad60757e811c71e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "朝<race_distance>前方的终点奔驰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfebe28115957508d07924c2fb8678d1e77cb909e8eba4a084a369432a421912",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3406"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:511c0ea03c74a05197ac9fd1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最精彩的竞赛，现在开始……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12ffc17c61f6ca72702fa99c1e5c39702f058e69492db25946f02483832c5e40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3407"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71581f980ec68dd476246391",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你支持哪一位赛马娘？",
      "source_fingerprint": "17a15c46d4fffae3d1122a4acd60467263d47ae018d15f36392ce7abe1728afe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3408"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0b3cdd8c68d3273253386c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能超越9人成为第1的会是谁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fdf2679c3f1e636e76b66ddc81e8e36b75f0f1f6689ee186bd5209ee280402d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3500"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90ed2f3add457211fbc58599",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获胜的会是哪位赛马娘呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41e9ed0044fe99ae5787383a926d39b23a84e045839723bf39696933cdd0fc44",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee7bf4a8d6e400b79cf28303",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "去抓住未来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46f8f579c965a4ae688c653c64907f9ca21e52904da88e75fd3ea0f5f7056953",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e8a93098179d0cddb1b9d70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "难以预料的伏兵也值得关注。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f590abbb84b5bbb076d2cf79ec676f9caf0ca189a37594af471eb4499f6168",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdca24a6cc2eed30b6911406",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终取得第1的会是……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe27e1663d0ddfc71ee7ed28daa5fd8e01bc7c0bb3183dec9626b24c90ecba28",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3504"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:889e50c4c09ceff24e5dfc4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "期待她们各自带着自信的表现吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "886da9b4cef997afeb65bddbae5aa4b36ec0e77bc379ef57cea234330138b68f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "3505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b48d6017bc705aae93cbc7f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color> 决赛终于即将开幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1be33f1ed069369a551bce9b3b31d89776bc7389afd99fba3d21b0461c1b26b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da6837a98bd3d4592d1babf0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于迎来了决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6631328f456a5a8f35eb860a89f31247d5983286be41e9961aa47d531a98091f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2fcd2706a58a421e555bb67",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "强者云集的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "082005fbee825863b8e090df6c859f75dc97ce6c98edd9629a31e1134d49c62a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88b7966bc8a38b813a0de0a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的梦想，以及我的梦想终于起步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f39156f0f0a7dc90e8ad7d4f394b38d324dc8c35c3e555bbf98148f6260c3ab6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f3d2d73c385988854c40d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于揭开序幕，<color=#ff9900>群英月赛\\n<race_name></color> 决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33d7e3aab3d189fd5633dc8ee9f6660359251833457a70c3926eb644f6a8b409",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9af2ba1917601b1d6b32dfd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "三方势均力敌，不容错过的盛大竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddb604b15fd9cc4c7a69cd80cc033fec21e3fd8c24b1a4bc02fd8e1743239479",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a1e5218ac4fc50621b0a74d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从全国聚集而来的精锐们，争夺顶点的盛大竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5e2c0a0f574faf056b1f5f8b3422a9067047c09773ee0f26595270b392d84d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13344645c6ed835a81a521f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "朝着闪亮荣耀前进的赛马娘们。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24979afe5e8256dfbd44b0505530670a425f2b13fb5554b2e08bf18e7a19bbae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fbb817ff206cae0d4419d4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会让赛场再次被卷入狂热的漩涡吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d553913cb16ab30852962a28aa0323018ea48919986278df2348462367d261fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a74271627aee752bc140c892",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最先通过<race_distance>终点的会是哪位赛马娘呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e84b3e5176603e75cb64b48ac18bb76da854bba869dc1ca7caab9cbdd71b03a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58e218328cf47f2ee637d042",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "伴随着感动那名留青史的一战将要开始。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32fb65e83d60c5ca50443cb1c3878afc83093b9c8b7151d187df774ded8b5ffe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd4c9926ef8b8718c03a41aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论是哭是笑都将在此决定，没有不会实现的梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0543b6f15fb8567fad676f94438618778b036bfa0e4549fcc05530ae50aeaac8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:238593d25c55bf1d799c82af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跨越激战的韦驮天们集结于此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4a37e63168b925fd64d88bb7a9a6b8b245d5bec70fe2714994d7fdaf66dc41b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d37e614bee84839cb40886fb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今日，或许将写下历史上全新的一页。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ace8b5a81cbbbf63859f93039dd948c84e1dadeb7b2460fe6440e31488a4570",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b763e90ab9927b516eb6176",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "掌握住荣光吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99cbd3cc406707f9f4733c87f9097b3c62fecff4f38bf29656ac12d4d632ab9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:547ebbb6dc9bcfce124de7c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "别错过奇迹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa40023845264d4618c35546e5a6df5fec219d73c5cb5af9fc5bec1b7b67c6fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:755784524c9de1dc14eaa675",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "朝着梦想奔驰吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f042e3fcab4d3f880001e400c81f7eb37352aa4773b7e4ecd306ca1345730c9e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc15d23b779c8e72d6f7acb1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胜利女神会对谁微笑？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c371904e2e7af77a4c9ce83b226387d83ceb3cf39cc167483caf1f16e17ba8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f629e0d3997d1784aa96f3a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "别错过新时代开幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "414585d42ff24b9a4a1dd9ee789f1db0c0954f37fe199daf1562298974a1ba29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41f212d72bb3b9ddae36f02b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让胜利女神着迷的会是谁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38fa359984a80bc64fb4e677ea1be140b484e977a7595e0fcc7a9a4932b1d947",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6815f17dc585fc2585fb97fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最快的荣耀会落在谁的手中？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c51310f1e3538198abcf21cf5228845df1aebe2e01c067cf85c061815810952a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba5835d3c8c6afdbc9ef1c11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拭目以待吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f913bcf2f40bf10e0758034140590b022053ef0903f402669d29d2e875dc341b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f6d144b688313985a5cc02",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在的她们快如阵风！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1de4cb3a45600f07c32123c0c08aea350f476e6225b119e63f4252432e12fe70",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9687924b71ffe845ca56e24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "见证传说的诞生吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "021342764cc522345c54bd0fac59e9ed0b6d41e74544d213b7265e13131d165c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ed5f6e0631458fd5e365d0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "体会何谓最强吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36cad121cb7a464b90f4d5cb989d0af89701f70d219accf356f16863bc562175",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afd3a988a257f882db43f36c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "手握闪亮荣耀的会是谁呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "936921264500da37e25481aae07dc0c411bea4ddf5ceb541e7d80bb5d4b40ec1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "4211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c729d9844b3b10a7d9d19f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛 <race_name></color> 决赛终于即将开幕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1be33f1ed069369a551bce9b3b31d89776bc7389afd99fba3d21b0461c1b26b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "5000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3cd5d5337853537c3505d44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于迎来了决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6631328f456a5a8f35eb860a89f31247d5983286be41e9961aa47d531a98091f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "5001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43155f4a51dbc6fa330bfff0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "强者云集的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "082005fbee825863b8e090df6c859f75dc97ce6c98edd9629a31e1134d49c62a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "5002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5761a6d954b627cdc1182473",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你的梦想，以及我的梦想终于起步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f39156f0f0a7dc90e8ad7d4f394b38d324dc8c35c3e555bbf98148f6260c3ab6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "5003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc768c6d8cfdc9fdf0ae3842",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终于揭开序幕，<color=#ff9900>群英月赛\\n<race_name></color> 决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33d7e3aab3d189fd5633dc8ee9f6660359251833457a70c3926eb644f6a8b409",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "201",
        "5004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7582f0b1198c349fb79025f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "三方势均力敌，不容错过的盛大竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddb604b15fd9cc4c7a69cd80cc033fec21e3fd8c24b1a4bc02fd8e1743239479",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
